      ],
      "content": "TRING RURAL            PUTTENHAM SP 81 SE 3/136                                   Statue of Adonis                                         next SE corner of -                                       house at Grange Farm GV                                      II Statue. '1741', 'JAN VAN LOGTTAREN' inscribed on base at side and rear. Brought from The Green Park, Aston Clinton c.1948. Carved stone. A larger than lifesize standing statue of a male figure with sandals and cloak accompanied by a winged child (now headless) standing over a rectangular quiver of arrows. Moulded bluestone plinth with concave corners. One of a matched pair with statue of Venus (q.v.) and one contemporary plinth is nearby (q.v.). Listing NGR: SP8856614704"
    }
